[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Naoya is the main protagonist of the story. He moved into the Natsume household after his father died. He cooks for the Natsume family since neither Ai, Kei, nor Shizuku can cook decent meals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After graduating from Yumihari Gakuen, he went on to a national art university and worked as a part-time lecturer at Yumihari Gakuen. In this work, he becomes a full-time employee and becomes an art teacher. Together with the students, he revives the prestigious Yumihari Gakuen Art Club"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33065"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。 無口でストイックなクール系を気取った熱血漢。天才画家草薙健一郎の子にして幼少期に神童と呼ばれるほどの腕を持ちながら現在は筆を折っている。長らく貧乏生活であったが、夏目家に厄介になる事で人並みの生活をおくれる様になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6528","sourceWorkId":"4529","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"サクラノ刻における主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弓張学園卒業後、国立の芸術大学に進み、弓張学園の非常勤講師として勤めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作品では正規雇用となり晴れて美術教員となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒達と共に名門弓張学園美術部を復活させる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6528","sourceWorkId":"25169","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。 無口でストイックなクール系を気取った熱血漢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才画家・草薙健一郎の子にして幼少期に神童と呼ばれるほどの腕を持ちながら、現在は筆を折っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長らく貧乏生活であったが、夏目家に厄介になることで人並みの生活を送れるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：基4%"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31322"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b6ce982be3ec61ea0190f838d1fd41df76b7cbea1a14586f28d3824c356b3f8b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9a5eccfe62c12b2b938c076f13f8d22d8b262612598ad0b33292ee6407a5a1f.webp","width":63,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35358","characterName":"夏目 圭","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"31323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"220921"},{"characterId":"31323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"22423"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6526"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35358"},"originalCharacterName":"夏目 圭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"330"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Naoya's good friend whom he has known ever since junior high."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After an eventful life, he enters the Natsume family. His personality gradually changes through encounters with Natsume Ai and a certain person. He still pursues Kusanagi Naoya, who broke his brush, as a goal. He believes in the genius of Kusanagi Naoya"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35358"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の親友。主人公とは中学以来の親友で、性格は快活で社交的。女の子と見まごう外見のため、学校内でもプチ有名人。父が死んで天涯孤独となった主人公を自分の家に誘い、半ば強引に（事故によって）同居させる。絵に対しては真剣で、直哉と共に草薙健一郎を超える世界的な芸術家になると信じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6526","sourceWorkId":"4529","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"波瀾万丈の人生を経て、夏目家に入る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏目藍やとある人物との出会いによって徐々にその性格を変えていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"筆を折った草薙直哉をいまだに目標として追い続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"草薙直哉の天才性を信じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6526","sourceWorkId":"25169","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の親友。 主人公とは中学以来の付き合いで、性格は快活で社交的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子と見まごう外見のため、学校内でもプチ有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父が死んで天涯孤独となった主人公を自分の家に誘い、半ば強引に （事故によって） 同居させる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵に対しては真剣で、直哉と共に草薙健一郎を超える世界的な芸術家になると信じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：基4%"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31323"}],"