se he suffers from blindness and for his condition, he carries around a white cane he named \"Tomoda Chisa\" (友田千紗), a pun on the word tomodachi. His mother committed suicide, which left a deep emotional scar on Takuma. To rectify this, he moves to the countryside to live with his uncle. Takuma is naturally friendly and likes to befriend everyone he meets in his new town. There is a rift between the rich and the poor, with Takuma being on the former end of the divide."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36815"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b667e45fdbe2c339386e5a9bd73a9e4a23ebdbac8d5aaca44b8a5493c414e6b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf12ba7553700612af3e36df75f4e9b90116b2daf0fd4513384502646c2468b0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36821","characterName":"音羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36821"},"originalCharacterName":"音羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"136"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"71"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true name is Kagura Hinata."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df0996e39501377ba3905aeb2aa30e951a4bd1a6874ca66301648bde904602f2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49c9cadf95c2d3b954111234fbdec55d1dd4e02477be8e285752324851ef354d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬 未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5697","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36822","characterName":"神楽 ひなた","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36822"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 ひなた","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1101"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinata is the granddaughter of the village headman, and is one of the rich members of town. She is in Takuma's class and is the council president for her class. She has a kind of obliging personality, and is popular in her school. She is clumsy and tends to fall down, and once she even fell down a flight of stairs at school, though luckily Takuma was there to break her fall. She refers to Takuma as \"Hirose-sama\", a very polite form of expression."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true name is Kagura Hotaru."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36822"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/